/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1005 0 R
/T (Four KPI summary cards that establish the population-level baseline. A horizontal bar chart breaks down average daily usage by platform, where WhatsApp leads in time spent followed by WhatsApp, TikTok and Snapchat, while a doughnut chart visualizes addiction category distribution with the High tier accounting for the largest segment. A supporting data table provides a platform-level breakdown of student count, addiction scores, usage hours, and average mental health scores.A bar chart plots average addiction score against reported conflict frequency, revealing a near-linear escalation that establishes interpersonal conflict as a strong behavioral signal of addiction. A treemap visualizes total usage hours by country, with India and the USA occupying the largest segments.)
