5090 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project presents a comprehensive Social Media Addiction Analyzer built around a Power BI dashboard that delivers rich, interactive visual analytics across a 705-student dataset. By transforming raw behavioral and demographic data into structured, explorable visuals, the dashboard provides a clear and evidence-backed lens through which social media addiction patterns among students can be understood and communicated.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2266 0 R
/Next 5226 0 R
>>
endobj
5091 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project demonstrates the practical value of data analytics and business intelligence in understanding and communicating the behavioral patterns of social media addiction among students. Future work could extend the dataset with longitudinal tracking, incorporate additional variables such as study hours and physical activity, and deploy the dashboard as a cloud-hosted institutional tool accessible to counselors, educators, and academic advisors.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2266 0 R
/Prev 5227 0 R
>>
endobj
