/Title (In India specifically, the situation is particularly concerning. Indians spend an average of 2.4 hours per day on social media, with young people aged 18 to 24 being the most active demographic. Facebook and Instagram alone account for 97.2 million and 69 million users from this age bracket in India respectively. Furthermore, approximately 85 percent of Indian children have reported experiencing cyberbullying, a rate more than twice the international average.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5483 0 R
/Prev 5509 0 R
/Next 5497 0 R
>>
